<title>USA: Katmandu Entertainment IPO raised to 2.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Katmandu Entertainment IPO raised to 2.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of shares in Katmandu Entertainment Corp's upcoming initial public offering has been raised to 2.5 million from 1.6 million, underwriter National Securities said on Friday.</p>
<p>The offering is tentatively set for the week of October 21. The proposed stock symbol is &quot;KATX.&quot;</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
